#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:202
#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:203
#: 099200c2135048d7b613afbd78030d80 0a934a151ea248a4ab14bc7a90f17e7a
#: 3852a255681340e59d25a190f3f7beaa 6fd7427dc3e142979bdd583c0ab358ed
#: 7c9e033f6a2046a6958f6200454702fa cb29b6a2c81a4e7b9ef76119a15fd246
msgid ""
"The graph below shows the ground and remote receiver strength vs distance "
"from home (in meters) for a test flight of a *3DR Radio* (SiK "
"implementation) on a SkyFun plane. The ground based radio was attached to a "
"3.5dB flat patch antenna. The SkyFun had a small 'wire' antenna. The graph "
"shows the vehicle reached a distance of nearly 3km and the link was "
"completely maintained throughout the flight."
msgstr ""
"下图显示了一次在SkyFun飞机上对 *3DR Radio* "
"（SiK实现）进行测试飞行时，地面和远端接收机信号强度与距Home点距离（米）的关系。地面电台连接了3.5dB平板天线，SkyFun使用小型「线材」天线。图表显示飞行器达到了近3km的距离，整个飞行过程中链路保持完好。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-sik-telemetry-radio.rst:212
