#: d1c7a43b1e75482591134e4ea6193ba6 d628bb13e3a94e4692fcc9006cce9da0
msgid ""
"Although anecdotal, another user provided a Tlog showing a good link kept "
"while the vehicle was 4.5km from the base station, using default radio "
"settings for a 3DR 900 radio. The plane used a small omni antenna, and a 8dB"
" patch antenna on the ground station."
msgstr ""
"虽属个案，但另一位用户提供了一份Tlog，显示使用3DR "
"900电台默认无线电设置，当飞行器距基站4.5km时仍保持良好链路。飞机使用小型全向天线，地面站使用8dB平板天线。"

